@startuml strong-bisimulation-flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #607D8B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
  FontColor #102027
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #455A64
}

title <b>Certified strong-bisimulation pipeline</b>\n<size:11>validated dense LTS · Valmari refinement · replay certificate · modal DAG</size>

start
:Raw labelled transition system\nstate count · arbitrary <b>u32</b> labels\ntransitions · initial colors; <<#BBDEFB>>
if (Every source and target is in range?\nColor vector has exact length?) then (yes)
  :Canonicalize labels with fixed-width radix passes\nsort and deduplicate set-valued transitions; <<#B2DFDB>>
else (no)
  :Return typed validation error\nwithout indexing malformed data; <<#FFCDD2>>
  stop
endif
:Build forward and reverse CSR\nplus refinable state/transition partitions; <<#B2DFDB>>
:Seed blocks by initial color\nseed splitter worklist; <<#C8E6C9>>
while (Splitter worklist nonempty?) is (yes)
  :Count predecessors by action and target block\nusing reverse CSR and explicit arrays; <<#C8E6C9>>
  :Refine the source-label subgroup\ninto selected and guarded remainder; <<#B2DFDB>>
  :Build guarded reaches and confined predicates\nfrom hash-consed modal nodes; <<#E1BEE7>>
  :Split confined, then reaching members\nqueue only the smaller physical half; <<#C8E6C9>>
  :Append both exact physical splits\nto the replay trace; <<#E1BEE7>>
endwhile (no)
:Assign canonical block IDs\nin increasing state order; <<#C8E6C9>>
:Independently rebuild and replay every split\ncheck canonical output and final stability; <<#FFCDD2>>
if (Queried states share a block?) then (yes)
  :Return canonical relation\nand replay certificate; <<#BBDEFB>>
else (no)
  :Select the earliest separating physical split\norient its predicate toward the left state; <<#E1BEE7>>
  :Evaluate the shared formula DAG\nwith an explicit heap pushdown machine; <<#E1BEE7>>
endif
stop
@enduml
